	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D3:\nVMID = 4.096 V x 10.0k / 24.7k = 1.658 V (half of a 3.3 V ADC). Other ADC range: re-select R51/R52. U29 runs at ~0.8 mA from +9 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37.06 93.98 0)
