	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\nI_RETURN_ADC = VMID + 0.201 V/mA: RSHR 10 mV/mA x 20.1 (U22A, R71/R70) + VMID (U22B, R72-R75 0.1 %). +/-5 mA -> 0.66-2.66 V."
